- document.js: the stream cursor was invisible in every theme (it lived in
  the hidden highlight overlay). One cached, empty, aria-hidden head is now
  seated before the overlay's trailing newline and re-seated after a
  mid-stream highlight pass.
- chat.js: the global pre-compact sweep skips #doc-editor-highlight (its
  +200px right padding put find marks a line low after wrapped lines).
- jarvis.css §9: ghost overlay + lit, blinking write head while streaming,
  top-edge scan, core + cyan EDITING tag; research running card with core +
  mono phase, tabular clock, lit progress hairline; sidebar core + R# label.
- Reduced motion: research orbit rAF no longer runs; section dot, synapse
  pulse and doc stream tag stop (all themes).
- docs/JARVIS_UI.md Run 23, ROADMAP.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
